# Build-context hygiene for the real-machine verification image.
#
# Everything excluded here is either local state, a build artifact that the
# gates regenerate inside the image, or a record that no gate reads. The build
# context must stay under 5 MB.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded:
#   packages/*/dist  - the LSP gate verifies the COMMITTED package dists
#                      against BUILD.lock; they are not rebuilt by build.mjs.
#   .github/workflows - §3 step 7 (scripts/verify-github-workflows.mjs) reads
#                      .github/workflows/*.yml, and docker/verify.sh runs that
#                      step HERE; excluding the whole .github dir would make
#                      the in-image gate suite weaker than CI's.

# local state / checkouts / caches
.git
.mpd
.codegraph
.port-src
.tmp
.bun-cache
node_modules

# root pack output (regenerated by scripts/pack-silicon.mjs inside the image)
dist

# evidence records, minus the corpus baseline the fidelity gate reads
evidence/*
!evidence/verification
evidence/verification/*
!evidence/verification/corpus-baseline.json

# .github: only the workflows are needed in the image (see note above)
.github/*
!.github/workflows
